# shapes/10-sbb-realization.shacl.ttl — dissertation §9.1: rho(S) = A enforcement
#
# Law: every SolutionBuildingBlock REALIZES exactly its qualifying ABB via
# ea:satisfiesABB. An SBB with no satisfiesABB link is unadmitted realization;
# an SBB pointing at a node that is not a typed ABB is a dangling realization.
# Together: rho(S) = A (the realization map lands in ABBs, total on SBBs).
#
# Pattern mirrors shapes/00-metamodel-hygiene.shacl.ttl (extraction pattern:
# canonical SHACL file + pyshacl court in tests/). Enforced by
# tests/test_shapes_10.py — real files, real pyshacl, no mocks.

@prefix f5ea: <https://ggen.io/ontology/fortune5-enterprise-architecture#> .
@prefix ea:   <https://chatman.ai/ontology/enterprise-architecture#> .
@prefix sh:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

f5ea:SBBRealizationShape a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass ea:SolutionBuildingBlock ;
  sh:property [
    sh:path ea:satisfiesABB ;
    sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;
    sh:class ea:ArchitectureBuildingBlock ;
    sh:severity sh:Violation ;
    sh:message "rho(S)=A: every SBB must satisfy exactly one typed ABB (ea:satisfiesABB); dangling or missing realization is a violation." ;
  ] .
